[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7862.069, "timestamp": "02:11:02", "text": "ただの「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7862.87, "timestamp": "02:11:02", "text": "はい」です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7863.669, "timestamp": "02:11:03", "text": "何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7866.629, "timestamp": "02:11:06", "text": "えっと、デッキセーブ。   そこには"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7869.51, "timestamp": "02:11:09", "text": "。 おお。 ああ、私は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7871.83, "timestamp": "02:11:11", "text": "ひどく転がらない限り大丈夫です。 これは正常な状態ですよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7872.79, "timestamp": "02:11:12", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7874.55, "timestamp": "02:11:14", "text": "ええ、これは普通のことです。 わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7877.35, "timestamp": "02:11:17", "text": "ええ、大丈夫です。 私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7878.87, "timestamp": "02:11:18", "text": "大丈夫なら別だけど。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7882.79, "timestamp": "02:11:22", "text": "待って、あなたは、えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7884.629, "timestamp": "02:11:24", "text": "初期段階で、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7887.27, "timestamp": "02:11:27", "text": "この利点を何と呼ぶのでしょうか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7889.109, "timestamp": "02:11:29", "text": "？ いいえ。えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7891.91, "timestamp": "02:11:31", "text": "Ka はあの反逆者みたいな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7893.27, "timestamp": "02:11:33", "text": "ものを持っていると思います。 あれって何ていう名前だったっけ？ 驚異的な"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7894.95, "timestamp": "02:11:34", "text": "回避。 でも待って、ちょっと待って。 不気味な回避ではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7896.229, "timestamp": "02:11:36", "text": "。 それって何ていう名前でしたっけ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7897.589, "timestamp": "02:11:37", "text": "半分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7899.109, "timestamp": "02:11:39", "text": "ダメージを与えると、ダメージがゼロになる効果のことです。 そして、もし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7900.149, "timestamp": "02:11:40", "text": "それがフルダメージだった場合、半分のダメージになります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7901.75, "timestamp": "02:11:41", "text": "。 名